      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// couldn\u0027t hide my folder as well\r\n#r \u0022C:\\Users\\saad\\Desktop\\MathGame\\bin\\Debug\\net10.0\\MathGame.dll\u0022\r\nusing MathGame;\r\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "29acf375-93b3-4f4d-bf15-9d2259ed9215",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Testing \u0060Problem.cs\u0060"
    },
    {
      "id": "39131e24-9272-4f8c-9261-e6c731412fbc",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "GameOptions options = new();\r\noptions.Difficulty = GameDifficulty.IMPOSSIBLE;\r\noptions.Operation = GameOperation.RANDOM;\r\nProblem problem = new(options);"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a341ca9-f2f2-4c64-9ec3-18cf50d94826",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Testing Question"
    },
